.cr-fo, buf_contract.fo-date, buf_contract.need-fo )           column-label 'Фин.об.' format "x(8)"  buf_contract.db-num           column-label 'БД'  Is-Master-Slave-Contract( BUFFER buf_Contract)           column-label 'Мастер!Договор' format "x(10)"
     1626         enable buf_contract.contract-type
